# main points into dist/ — excluding it produces "Extension entrypoint(s)
# missing", the most common bundling-related packaging failure. Re-include
# explicitly. Do NOT also add a "files" array to package.json: vsce exits 1
# on "VSCE does not support combining both strategies".
!dist/**
!media/**
!schemas/**
!skill/**
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
